"CodaLab is used actively in research. In 2019/2020, 400 new challenges were "
"launched. Recent popular challenges organized with CodaLab include the <a "
"href=\"%(covid_url)s\">COVID-19 retweet prediction challenge</a>, the <a "
"href=\"%(eccv_url)s\">ECCV 2020 ChaLearn LAP Fair face recognition "
"challenge</a>, the 2020 <a href=\"%(driveml_url)s\">DriveML Huawei "
"Autonomous Vehicle Challenge</a>, and high profile challenges include the <a"
" class=\"large_links\" href=\"%(see4c_url)s\">2 million Euro prize of the "
