"CodaLab 在科研中被广泛使用。2019/2020 年间，共有 400 个新挑战上线。近期在 CodaLab 上举办的热门挑战包括 <a "
"href=\"%(covid_url)s\">COVID-19 转发预测挑战</a>、<a href=\"%(eccv_url)s\">ECCV "
"2020 ChaLearn LAP 公平人脸识别挑战</a>、2020 年的 <a href=\"%(driveml_url)s\">DriveML "
"华为自动驾驶挑战</a> 等。高影响力的赛事还包括 <a class=\"large_links\" href=\"%(see4c_url)s\">欧盟"
" See.4C 联盟 200 万欧元大奖</a>、吸引 493 名参赛者的 <a class=\"large_links\" "
"href=\"%(cikm_url)s\">CIKM AnalytiCup 2017</a>、拥有 633 名参赛者的 <a "
"class=\"large_links\" href=\"%(mscoco_url)s\">MSCOCO</a>，以及 687 名参赛者参加的 <a "
"class=\"large_links\" href=\"%(automl_url)s\">ChaLearn AutoML 2017 挑战</a>。"

#: src/templates/pages/home.html:189
msgid ""
"Since 2016, CodaLab offers the possibility of organizing machine learning "
"challenges with code submission. The simplest machine learning challenges "
"require only the submission of results, which are compared to a solution (or"
" key) by a scoring program. Result submission challenges are less "
"computationally expensive than code submission challenges. However, they "
"offer less possibilities. In particular, code submission allows conducting "
"fair benchmarks by executing submitted code in the same condition for all "
"participants."
msgstr ""
"自 2016 年起，CodaLab "
"支持举办需要提交代码的机器学习挑战。最简单的挑战只需提交结果，评分程序将其与标准答案（或金钥匙）比较。结果提交挑战计算成本较低，但灵活性有限。相比之下，代码提交能够在同等条件下运行参赛者代码，确保基准公平性。"

